===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|посълъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*posъlъ}}. Probably originally deverbal from the ancestor of {{m|ru|посла́ть}}, or alternatively from {{cog|sla-pro|*po-}} + the deverbal form of {{m|sla-pro|*sъlati}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|b|посо́л|*|a=an|f=посли́ца<q:pejorative>|adj=посо́льский}}

# [[ambassador]]; [[legate]]

